values.value:
Accepted:

I <contact_full_name> accept from Qantas Airways Limited (ABN 16 009 661 901) the total amount owed and offered in the email as payment made without admission of liability in full and final settlement of all claims of any nature, arising out of or in connection with the Claim. In consideration of the above payment, I agree:

(a) to refrain from taking, and take all steps necessary to withdraw, any legal action or proceeding commenced in any court or tribunal in relation to the Claim;

(b) to keep this document, the settlement and all correspondence and information relating to the Claim confidential;

(c) to release Qantas Airways Limited, and its employees and agents from all other claims made by any person in relation to or as a consequence of the Claim; and

(d) that this Settlement and Release may be used and disclosed to enforce its terms, in defence against any legal action or proceedings in relation to the Claim, or as required by law.
